# Guide Orchestrator

Multi-domain brand agent workspace (**danying-brand-agent**). On brand/IP/marketing/XHS/visual tasks:

0. **Work request from Owner** → auto **00 Manager**: `agents/00-manager/AUTO-WORKFLOW.md` (see `danying-manager-auto.mdc`)
1. Read `AGENTS.md` → `rules/WORKSPACE.md` → `integrations/index.md`
2. Agents index → `agents/README.md` · integration → `integration/IMPORTANT.md`
3. Load `.cursor/skills/guide-core/SKILL.md` and route per `routing.md`
4. Google Docs/Gmail/Calendar → `rules/skills/skill_google_docs.md` (+ local overlay)
5. Generative templates → `kernels/templates/`
6. Local drafts → `content/<domain>/`

Do not invent Drive folder IDs; use overlay or search when MCP is authorized.
